{{!
    @template enrol_apply/queue_chip

    One applied filter, named and removable.

    A partial of its own so the markup exists once: the server renders it when the page loads,
    and the queue's module renders it through core/templates after an as-you-type refresh, which
    replaces only the table's region and would otherwise leave chips describing filters that are
    no longer applied.

    The remove control is a real link with a working href, so it survives with scripting off and
    gives the right address to a middle-click or a copied link; the module intercepts the click
    rather than replacing the element.

    Its label is real text in a visually-hidden span rather than an aria-label, and the glyph is
    hidden from assistive technology so the two are not announced together. Mink's link selector
    never reads aria-label, so the hidden text is also what lets a Behat step click the control
    by name.

    That hidden text is real page text repeating the filter's name and value - "Remove the filter
    Search: goncalves" beside the chip's own "Search goncalves" - so a whole-page assertion has to
    pick wording only one of them carries, such as the colon.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none - the module matches on data-region.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region="chip" on the wrapper, so the row can be emptied and refilled.
    * data-filter on the remove link, naming which filter it drops.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * filter string - the filter's name, as the table's filterset knows it
    * name string - what the filter is called, in the reader's language
    * value string - what it is set to
    * removeurl string - url of the same listing without this one filter
    * removelabel string - accessible wording of the remove control

    Example context (json): {
        "filter": "search",
        "name": "Search",
        "value": "goncalves",
        "removeurl": "https://example.com/enrol/apply/manage.php?id=140",
        "removelabel": "Remove the filter Search: goncalves"
    }
}}
<span class="enrol_apply-chip" data-region="chip">
    <span class="enrol_apply-chipname">{{name}}</span> {{value}}
    <a href="{{removeurl}}" class="enrol_apply-chipremove" data-filter="{{filter}}"><span aria-hidden="true">&#10005;</span><span class="visually-hidden">{{removelabel}}</span></a>
</span>
